# Short /faction scenes (4-9 lines each): quick exchanges players had every night in 2001-2003,
# Classic and Shrouded Isles. New writing for this project. Most beats carry alternatives so a scene
# plays differently each time; "?" beats are optional.

@kind debate

# ======================= Any realm =======================
@realm *

@topic camp_check
@levels 10-40
@scene sh_camp_check_taken
@role B type=Leveler
A: anyone at {camp}? | {q} is {camp} taken right now | camp check {camp}, anybody there
B: we are, full group, sorry | yeah we have it, been here a while | taken, but we might pack up soon
A: how long are you staying | any idea when you are done | ok, mind if i wait close by
B: an hour maybe, our healer has to log soon | until someone falls asleep at the keyboard | hard to say, we keep saying one more pull
?C: try {zone}, it was empty when i left | {zone} was wide open a bit ago | nobody at all in {zone} when i rode through
A: ty, heading over | cool thanks | ok np, gl with the pulls

@topic camp_sharing
@levels 15-45
@scene sh_camp_share
@role B type=Daredevil
@role C type=Socialite
A: someone just pulled our spawn at {camp} | some solo guy keeps tagging our pulls at {camp} | who keeps grabbing mobs at {camp}
B: that was me, didnt see a group there | oops, my bad, thought it was free | sorry, it looked like nobody was on it
A: we have been here two hours lol | we have the camp, check before you pull pls | there are six of us standing right here
B: want to just join? i can pull | how about i take the far spawn and you keep the near one
C: split the camp, everyone gets xp, nobody types angry essays | sharing beats arguing about who got there first
?A: fine, works for me | ok, deal | alright, as long as you ask first next time
B: deal | ty, i will stay out of your way | works for me

@topic trainer
@levels 1-10
@scene sh_trainer_where
@role B type=*
@role C type=Socialite
A: where do i find my trainer? | how do i train, cant find the guy | {q} where are the trainers
B: every starter town has trainers, and {capital} has all of them | look for the npc with your class guild in the title
C: and spend your points while you are there | dont forget to train your specs when you visit
A: wait i have points to spend? | i have been leveling with nothing trained lol | train? i thought it was automatic
?C: lol, go train, you will feel twice as strong | that explains why you hit like a wet noodle | oh no. go now
A: on my way, ty | heading there now, thx both | ok running to town

@topic stable_master
@levels 5-30
@scene sh_stable_master
@role C type=Socialite
A: where is the stable master? | how do i get a horse to {zone} | anyone know where the horse guy is
B: find the stable master and buy a ticket, the horse knows the way | look for the horses and the guy standing next to them
C: you dont get to steer btw, the horse goes where it goes | its a ticket, not a pet, and it picks the road for you
?A: wait i cant steer? | so i just sit there? | is the ride long
C: sit back and alt tab, best part of the trip | grab a snack, its a scenic route | enjoy the view, its free
A: lol ok ty | sounds relaxing actually | fine by me

@topic rez_request
@levels 10-50
@scene sh_need_rez
@role B type=*
A: anyone have a rez near {zone}? | died in {zone}, any healer close for a rez | lf rez in {zone}, will owe you big
B: where exactly? | omw, which part of the zone | i can come, give me a minute
A: right by the {monster} spawn | near where the {monster} hangs out, you will see my body | by the {monster}, sorry, its a bad spot
?C: careful, those aggro on rezzers too | dont get the healer killed as well lol | bring a friend, that spot bites
B: found you, accept it | rez coming, hit yes | there you go
A: ty ty, saved me the run | owe you one | thank you, the walk back is brutal

@topic ding
@levels 10-49
@scene sh_ding_gz_joke
@role B type=Socialite
@role C type=*
A: ding {level}! | DING {level} | finally, ding {level}
B: gz! | grats | gz, about time
C: grats, only a few dozen levels to go | gz, see you at the next ding in a week | nice, still a long walk to 50 though
A: way to ruin the moment lol | thanks for that, very motivating | there is always one
?B: gz anyway, ignore the grump | dont listen to them, enjoy the ding | celebrate, the next one can wait
C: hey, my grats was sincere | in my defense i said grats first | i was being supportive in my own way

@topic price_check
@levels 20-50
@scene sh_price_check
@role B type=Crafter
@role C type=*
A: pc on {item}? | price check {item}, anyone | what does {item} usually go for
B: depends on the bonuses, what does it have | hard to say without knowing what it does | what stats are on it
?A: some strength, some con, nothing crazy | decent bonuses, nothing fancy | it has a proc, thats all i know
C: whatever someone will pay, thats the price | sell it to the first person who does not laugh | ask high, they will tell you if you are wrong
B: if it procs, ask a lot. if not, ask a little | crafted stuff is cheap now, dont aim too high | most people would rather buy crafted, keep it modest
A: ok ill start high and drop | fair, putting it up to see what bites | guess i will find out

@topic selling_drop
@levels 15-50
@scene sh_selling_drop
@role B type=*
@role C type=*
A: selling {item}, pst | wts {item}, decent bonuses, pst offers | got {item} off a named, anyone want it
B: what class can use it | is it any good for casters | what bonuses does it have
A: good for melee mostly | it has strength on it, so probably not you | a tank would love it
?C: is faction the trade channel now | no shopping in my faction chat pls | wrong channel for selling lol
B: pass then, ty | might take it for my alt, sending a tell | hm, maybe, i will pst you
A: np | ty, still open to offers | ok, holding it for a bit

@topic mez_break
@levels 20-50
@scene sh_mez_break_blame
@role B type=*
@role C type=Daredevil
A: who broke mez, the whole camp just woke up | mez broke and we wiped, who did it | someone broke the mez again
C: i only had one dot out... oh | uh, does a dot count | i might have put a dot on the wrong one
B: the dot. the dot broke it | dots break mez, every time, every single time | that dot ticked on the mezzed one
C: sorry, sorry | ok that one is on me | i will only dot the assist target, promise
?D: happens to everyone once | at least you admit it, most never do | everyone breaks one mez in their life
A: run back and rebuff, we go again | lol fine, everyone run back | ok, regroup at the camp

@topic spec_question
@levels 5-30
@scene sh_spec_deep_or_wide
@role B type=NoLifer
@role C type=Leveler
A: {q} should a {class} go deep in one line or spread out? | is it better to spread spec points or put them all in one line
B: deep. one line high beats two lines halfway | go deep in your main line, everything else is filler
C: spread it, leveling is easier with a few tools | a little of everything solos better early on
B: tools dont matter if nothing lands | early on maybe, by 50 you will wish you had gone deep
?A: so the answer is... | great, two answers and both sound right | i am more confused than before
B: deep | go deep, trust me
C: spread | spread, trust me instead

@topic guild_search
@levels 10-40
@scene sh_lf_guild_casual
@role B type=Socialite
@role C type=*
A: any guilds recruiting? casual, evenings mostly | lf a guild, nothing hardcore, just people to group with | looking for a small guild, anyone
B: we are small, mostly evenings, pst | my guild is like six people and a dog, want in? | we would take you, we have a few at your level
C: ask what they do first, some guilds only do rvr | make sure people actually log on, half the guilds are empty rosters
A: mostly pve for now, some rvr later | i just want people who answer in guild chat | anything with people awake at night
B: thats us, we never shut up | we talk more than we play honestly | we have that, plenty of chatter
?C: sounds like a fit then | ok they seem alright
A: tell on its way | pst incoming | sent you a tell

@topic keep_inc
@levels 35-50
@scene sh_inc_keep_ram
@role B type=NoLifer
@role C type=Daredevil
A: INC {keep}, {enemy} with a ram! | {enemy} at {keep}, they have a ram up | {keep} under attack, need bodies now
B: how many | numbers? | how big is the group
A: two groups at least, maybe more | a full zerg, cant even count them | looks like one group and some stragglers
C: omw from {frontier} | coming, riding in now | on my way, save me a few
?D: anyone on the walls or just you | who is defending right now | how many of us are inside
A: just me and the guards lol | the guards are doing their best | its me and a lot of hope
B: hold on, help coming | hang in there, we are close | stall them, we are almost there

@topic stealther_warning
@levels 30-50
@scene sh_stealther_on_road
@role B type=*
A: stealther near {keep}, watch yourselves | careful in {frontier}, a stealther just jumped me | {enemy} stealther camping the road to {keep}
B: what class | which kind | did you see who it was
A: no idea, i was dead before i saw anything | couldnt tell, two hits and gone | something with daggers, that narrows it down lol
?C: they always pick the lone healer | and this is why nobody rides out alone | they love that road
B: group up before you ride out | ride in pairs, they wont jump two | heading there now, will sweep it
A: ty, waiting at the door | ok, released, will wait for a group | thx, staying put for now

@topic afk_jokes
@levels 5-50
@scene sh_afk_dinner_joke
@role B type=Socialite
A: brb, dinner | afk, food | brb, getting called down to eat
B: dont die | take your time, the monsters will wait | bring some back for us
?C: famous last words, they come back to a corpse | betting they come back dead
A: relax, im in {capital} | im in town, nothing can reach me | i parked somewhere safe
C: thats what the last guy said | sure, until someone trains a guard on you | ok, we will see
?B: i will guard your body | i will keep an eye on you

@topic back_from_afk
@levels 5-50
@scene sh_back_from_dinner
@role B type=*
@role C type=Socialite
A: back, what did i miss | back from dinner | ok back, anything happen
B: you missed a whole wipe, it was beautiful | we leveled twice while you ate | the healer quit, its just us now
A: really? | wait what | ugh, of course
B: no lol, we just sat here | kidding, we sat and waited | lol no, nothing happened
?C: what was dinner | did you bring any back | hope it was worth the wait
