@topic newbie_greys
@levels 1-15
@scene sh_newbie_grey_xp
@role B type=*
@role C type=Socialite
A: why am i getting no xp | been killing these for ages and my bar wont move | is xp broken? nothing moves
B: what color do they con | check the con color, grey gives nothing | are they grey to you?
A: grey i think | whats con | they look kind of grey yeah
C: grey means too easy, no xp, go find blue or yellow ones | find stuff that cons blue or yellow, that is where the xp is
?B: and stay away from red for now | purple means run, just so you know | orange is fine with a friend, red is not
A: oh. ty | that explains a lot lol | ok moving on

@topic newbie_bind
@levels 1-15
@scene sh_newbie_bind_point
@role B type=*
@role C type=*
